{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"34387","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v44890","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"orico","creatorId":"vndb:s15731","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:26852","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15731","name":"orico","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:265682","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"和泉万夜","creatorId":"vndb:s217","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1614","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s217","name":"和泉万夜","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:265683","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"ゆあタン","creatorId":"vndb:s24706","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24706","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24706","name":"ゆあタン","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:196518","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c127659","characterName":"瀬ケ崎 真央","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133135","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"442591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24812"],"vndbCharacterId":"c127659"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬ケ崎 真央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"126"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"P"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"65"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strong-willed and fastidious, the president of a design company who is strict with others but does her work really well. This time, in order to cover up the traffic accident caused by her sister Mio, she does not call an ambulance for Naoki, and instead, hides him in her own home, planning to keep the accident hidden. Her selfishness and one-sided arguments eventually get on his nerves, so he rapes her against her will. She resists at first, but due to the fear of losing her social status, she leaves herself at his mercy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127659"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強く潔癖で、他人にも厳しいが滅茶苦茶仕事が出来るデザイン事務所の社長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、妹の美央が起こした交通事故を隠ぺいするため、事故後に救急車を呼ばず自らの自宅に匿い、表沙汰にならないように画策した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その際の自分勝手で一方的な言い分が主人公の逆鱗に触れてしまい、良い様に手籠めにされてしまう。初めは抵抗するが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社会的地位を失うことを恐れて主人公の言いなりになっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強く潔癖で、他人にも厳しいが滅茶苦茶仕事が出来るデザイン事務所の社長。今回、妹の美央が起こした交通事故を隠ぺいするため、事故後に救急車を呼ばず自らの自宅に匿い、表沙汰にならないように画策した。その際の自分勝手で一方的な言い分が主人公の逆鱗に触れてしまい、良い様に手籠めにされてしまう。初めは抵抗するが、社会的地位を失うことを恐れて主人公の言いなりになっていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133135"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"126 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"p","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"174 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"65 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24812","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41fb70510ff99d3041e04c9b3af51fce9949069e5d5ef5f7765cea2eec5147b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/431eaea88a931acb67d1cc5d3866d1948b35b7ae260fb696f16ee567633e1b7c.webp","width":134,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西口有香","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:442591:133135:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c127660","characterName":"瀬ケ崎 美央","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133136","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"442591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24813"],"vndbCharacterId":"c127660"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬ケ崎 美央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"103"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"I"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The woman who runs over Naoki at the beginning of the story. As a matter of fact, she has received an unofficial job offer from a television station, so to cover up the accident, she asks her sister Mao for help, hiding Naoki in the apartment where they live. Despite being the one who caused the accident, without hiding it, she shows a strong feeling of disgust towards Naoki, repeating displeasure​ words and actions, which become the fuel for his anger. After seeing her sister getting banged by him, she interrogates him, however......"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127660"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の初めに主人公を車で轢いた張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は局アナの内定を受けており、それをもみ消すため姉の真央の力を借り、主人公を二人で住んでいるマンショ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ンに匿う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし事故の加害者のくせに主人公に対してあからさまに嫌悪感丸出しの態度を取り、不快感を煽る言動を繰り返すため、彼の逆鱗に触れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉が主人公に凌辱されているのを見てしまい、彼を問いただすが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の初めに主人公を車で轢いた張本人。実は局アナの内定を受けており、それをもみ消すため姉の真央の力を借り、主人公を二人で住んでいるマンションに匿う。しかし事故の加害者のくせに主人公に対してあからさまに嫌悪感丸出しの態度を取り、不快感を煽る言動を繰り返すため、彼の逆鱗に触れる。姉が主人公に凌辱されているのを見てしまい、彼に問いただすが…"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133136"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"103 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"i","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24813","sourceWorkId":"34387","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85cb121d9f2c2827545310c3fd516f8616cfca20c245471a3afb05ce95cd09d4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-asset